{"at": "2026-07-13T00:59:54Z", "commit_ref": "17d4f33", "decision": "include", "gate": "unit-tests", "rationale": "Borderline, included per default-inclusion bias. Spec edits are OpticalConstructor-only (no pure-solver change), but the gate's applies_to matches Berreman/**/*.fs and Part B (steps 4-5) re-seeds MaterialLibrary presets through the shared dispersion-model ladder, so BerremanTests is cheap regression insurance for the solver primitives; count_at_least baseline must hold. Operator may exclude post-cycle."}
{"at": "2026-07-13T00:59:54Z", "commit_ref": "17d4f33", "decision": "include", "gate": "constructor-unit-tests", "rationale": "Covers the pure-Domain testable surface named in spec-md 0.3 and every step touching OpticalConstructor.Tests: Part A Facets.buildTree label sort + control-local State/Handlers (steps 1-3), Part B seed re-classification + Anisotropy/Transparency totality (steps 4-5), Part D validateSample/supportedEmission/MeasurementMode.ofEmission (steps 8-9,12). applies_to Berreman/OpticalConstructor/** matches; count_at_least baseline should grow as the spec adds tests."}
{"at": "2026-07-13T00:59:54Z", "commit_ref": "17d4f33", "decision": "include", "gate": "ui-smoke", "rationale": "spec-md 0.3 and step 13 (WIRE_UI, AC-W1) require the Avalonia.Headless smoke suite to render one frame each for the Materials/Library windows, Material editor, and Sample editor over the new tree/chart/emission behaviour without throwing. Parts A/C/D edit OpticalConstructor.Ui views plus the OpticalConstructor.Controls (FacetedTreeControls) they consume; ui-smoke exercises them transitively."}
{"at": "2026-07-13T00:59:54Z", "commit_ref": "17d4f33", "decision": "include", "gate": "ui-tests", "rationale": "Per-panel headless interaction tests cover the new interactive controls named in spec-md 0.3: Part A chevron toggleNode + visible selection (steps 2-3), Part C restricted gyration/mu charts (step 6), Part D Plate R/T checkboxes + substrate Select-window flow (steps 10-11), each carrying stable UiIds AutomationIds with OpticalConstructor.Ui.Tests coverage. count_at_least baseline should grow."}
